  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0 adds the step-by-step BelotMatch API, seat views, match records, action validation and seeded deals. It fixes scoring, declarations and trick obligations and reduces hot-path allocations. Engine only; no AI players or third-party runtime dependencies. Recompile consumers: CardCollection.GetEnumerator now returns a struct, and Highest/Lowest keys must implement IComparable<TKey>. See the package README for migration notes.",
